\description{
Downloads modeled malaria raster surfaces from the \strong{Malaria Atlas Project}
(MAP) GeoServer via WCS 2.0.1, extracts zonal statistics for a user-defined
region and time range, and returns an \code{sf} or \code{tibble}.

Available species: \emph{Plasmodium falciparum} (\code{"pf"}) and
\emph{Plasmodium vivax} (\code{"pv"}).
Available measures: \code{"incidence_rate"}, \code{"incidence_count"},
\code{"parasite_rate"}, \code{"mortality_rate"}, \code{"mortality_count"}.
The function automatically selects the \strong{latest release} available on the
server for the requested species + measure combination.

